#: ../../source/houses.md:1
msgid "House Systems"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/houses.md:3
msgid ""
"House systems divide the celestial sphere into twelve segments, called "
"**houses**, starting from the Ascendant (the eastern horizon at the "
"moment of birth). Each system uses a different mathematical projection to"
" do this division, which is why the same chart can look markedly "
"different depending on which system you choose. Ketu ships six systems "
"and lets you register additional ones."
msgstr ""

